<category>
<pattern>WHAT ARE SOME NOTABLE FEATURES OF INTERBBS BLACKJACK DOOR</pattern>
<template>InterBBS BlackJack supports multi-node operation, packet radio integration, and complaint handling. It is designed for FidoNet DoorGames and related BBS software.</template>
