<pattern>WHAT IS PURPOSE OF COMPLAINT DEPARTMENT CDEPT22C IN DOOR UTILITIES</pattern>
<template>The Complaint Department provides user feedback mechanisms for sysops managing multiple doors. It is a crucial feature for maintaining a positive and respectful environment on BBS networks.</template>
</category>
<category>
